<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 68.5303 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 68.5303 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 68.5303 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.3865 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 3		   Sep 2</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     68.5303		 68.3865</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		 14.750		   9.925</p>
<p>				    Sep 3		   Aug 29</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 46,3500		 46,4414</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0,100		   0,035</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
